# Agent guide (Orcan product)

**Orcan** = Docker **work-context orchestrator** (workspaces, path parity, context pack).
Agent CLIs (`agent`, `claude`, `codex`) are tools inside it — **models are out of scope**.

Display name: **Orcan**. Ids: `orcan`, `ORCAN_*`. Only product name in docs/UI text.

## Read order

1. This rule (always on) — compact orientation
2. Root [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) (= [`CLAUDE.md`](../../CLAUDE.md)) — full SoT; keep identical
3. [`docs/llms.txt`](../../docs/llms.txt) — public care / non-goals index
4. [`docs/en/ai/project-context.md`](../../docs/en/ai/project-context.md) / [`change-map.md`](../../docs/en/change-map.md)

In workspace `orcan-dev`: honour the workspace context pack, then `cd orcan/` and follow **this repo’s** `AGENTS.md`.

## 30-second map

| | |
| --- | --- |
| **Product** | Workspaces + path parity + context pack — **not** model routing |
| **API** | `orcan` CLI — not Make; not deprecated user targets |
| **Config** | JSON `orcan.config.json` in **`ORCAN_HOME`**; tool data in **`ORCAN_DATA`** (both default `~/.config/orcan`); `orcan sync` after edits (`up` does **not** sync) |
| **Runtime** | enter → cockpit → tmux → zsh; CMD `orcan-supervisord` + `context-scan`/`recap` |
| **Cockpit** | `🌀 orcan` (About) + 🔔 Problems/? \| workspaces + glance + ASSERTIONS \| tmux; **F2** · **F4** · **F1**/? · **F5** peek · **`i`** · **`r`**/`**p`**/`**o`** · **`lg`** (no F3) |
| **UX work** | `make dev-*` → `orcan:dev-ux` — not the user’s daily install |
| **Image FS** | `docker/rootfs/` — repo `.cursor/rules/` ≠ image `cursor-defaults/` |
| **Checks** | `make validate` · `test-host` · `docs-check`; UX: `dev-checklist` |

## Ritual (host)

```bash
orcan init            # or context add / tui / edit orcan.config.json
orcan sync            # ALWAYS after config changes
orcan build           # after Dockerfile / docker/rootfs / cockpit image inputs
orcan up              # daily; --with-ttyd for browser
orcan sync --context  # inbox compile only (host)
```

Live reconcile often avoids recreate — `docs/en/ideas/runtime-reconcile.md`.
When overlays need it: `orcan down && orcan up`.

## Non-goals (do not invent)

- Model selection / provider routing
- CI image publish; registry-as-product
- YAML user profiles / host-deps
- Deprecated user Make targets as the primary UX
- Drive-by refactors or speculative layers

## Done checklist

- [ ] Surgical diff only
- [ ] `make validate` · `make test-host`
- [ ] `make docs-check` when docs/interface changed
- [ ] UX: `make dev-restart` + `dev-smoke` / `dev-a11y` / `dev-visual` as needed
- [ ] If you change `AGENTS.md`, copy to `CLAUDE.md`
- [ ] No secrets; report what ran / skipped; no AI commit trailers

Pitfalls (Textual box-model, Alt+1..9, F1 vs `?`, browser Alt+arrows/`BROWSER_KEY_LIMIT`, …): see **Cockpit / Textual pitfalls** in `AGENTS.md`.
